ADDRESS: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988
==================================================
the oil platform  [LINK: (Piper Alpha) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piper_Alpha]  explodes and collapses in the  [LINK: (North Sea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Sea] , killing 165 workers;

the  [LINK: (USS Vincennes (CG-49)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/USS_Vincennes_(CG-49)]  mistakenly shoots down  [LINK: (Iran Air Flight 655) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran_Air_Flight_655] , killing all 290 people on board;

[LINK: (Australia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australia]  celebrates its  [LINK: (Bicentennial) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_Bicentenary]  on  [LINK: (January 26) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_26] ;

[LINK: (Abdelbaset al-Megrahi) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdelbaset_al-Megrahi]  bombs  [LINK: (Pan Am Flight 103) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pan_Am_Flight_103] , causing the plane to crash down on the town of  [LINK: (Lockerbie) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lockerbie] ,  [LINK: (Scotland) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotland] ,  killing 270 people;

the  [LINK: (1988 Summer Olympics) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Summer_Olympics]  are held in  [LINK: (Seoul) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seoul] ,  [LINK: (South Korea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Korea] ;

[LINK: (Soviet) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union]  troops begin their  [LINK: (withdrawal) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_withdrawal_from_Afghanistan]  from  [LINK: (Afghanistan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afghanistan] , which is completed the  [LINK: (next year) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1989] ;

an  [LINK: (earthquake) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Armenian_earthquake]  in  [LINK: (Armenia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armenia]  kills between 25,000 and 50,000 people;

the  [LINK: (8888 Uprising) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/8888_Uprising]  in  [LINK: (Myanmar) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myanmar] , led by students, protests the  [LINK: (Burma Socialist Programme Party) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burma_Socialist_Programme_Party] ;

[LINK: (Who Framed Roger Rabbit) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Who_Framed_Roger_Rabbit]  is released, sparking a newfound interest in  [LINK: (animation) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Animation]  and leading to the  [LINK: (Disney Renaissance) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disney_Renaissance]  and the  [LINK: (Modern Age of American animation) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modern_animation_in_the_United_States] .

