1988 ( [LINK: (MCMLXXXVIII) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_numerals] ) was a  [LINK: (leap year starting on Friday) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leap_year_starting_on_Friday]  of the  [LINK: (Gregorian calendar) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregorian_calendar] , the 1988th year of the  [LINK: (Common Era) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_Era]  (CE) and  [LINK: (Anno Domini) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anno_Domini]  (AD) designations, the 988th  year of the  [LINK: (2nd millennium) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2nd_millennium] , the 88th  year of the  [LINK: (20th century) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/20th_century] , and the  9th   year of the  [LINK: (1980s) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980s]  decade.

1988 was a crucial year in the early history of the  [LINK: (Internet) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet] —it was the year of the first well-known  [LINK: (computer virus) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_virus] , the  [LINK: (1988 Internet worm) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morris_worm] . The first permanent intercontinental Internet link was made between the United States ( [LINK: (National Science Foundation Network) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_Science_Foundation_Network] ) and Europe (Nordunet) as well as the first Internet-based chat protocol,  [LINK: (Internet Relay Chat) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_Relay_Chat] . [LINK: ([1]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-1]  The concept of the  [LINK: (World Wide Web) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Wide_Web]  was first discussed at  [LINK: (CERN) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CERN]  in 1988. [LINK: ([2]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-2]

The  [LINK: (Soviet Union) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Union]  began its major deconstructing towards a  [LINK: (mixed economy) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixed_economy]  at the beginning of 1988 and began its  [LINK: (gradual dissolution) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dissolution_of_the_Soviet_Union] . The  [LINK: (Iron Curtain) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_Curtain]  began to disintegrate in 1988 as  [LINK: (Hungary) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/People%27s_Republic_of_Hungary]  began allowing freer travel to the  [LINK: (Western world) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Western_world] . [LINK: ([3]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-3]  The first  [LINK: (extrasolar planet) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Extrasolar_planet] ,  [LINK: (Gamma Cephei Ab) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gamma_Cephei_Ab]  (confirmed in 2003), was detected this year and the  [LINK: (World Health Organization) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Health_Organization]  began its mission to  [LINK: (eradicate polio) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eradication_of_polio] .  [LINK: (Global warming) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_warming]  also began to emerge as a more significant concern, with climate scientist  [LINK: (James Hansen) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Hansen]  testifying before the U.S. Senate on the issue.


# EVENTS #

January – The cargo ship  [LINK: (Khian Sea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khian_Sea_waste_disposal_incident]  deposits 4,000 tons of toxic waste in  [LINK: (Haiti) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haiti]  after wandering around the Atlantic for sixteen months. [LINK: ([4]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-4]

[LINK: (January 1) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_1]  – The Soviet Union begins its program of economic restructuring ( [LINK: (perestroika) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perestroika] ) with legislation initiated by Premier  [LINK: (Mikhail Gorbachev) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mikhail_Gorbachev]  (though Gorbachev had begun minor restructuring in 1985). [LINK: ([5]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-5]

[LINK: (January 7) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_7] – [LINK: (8) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_8]  – In the  [LINK: (Soviet-Afghan War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet%E2%80%93Afghan_War] , 39 men of the  [LINK: (Soviet Airborne Troops) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_Airborne_Troops]  from the  [LINK: (345th Independent Guards Airborne Regiment) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/345th_Independent_Guards_Airborne_Regiment]  fight off an attack by 200 to 250  [LINK: (Mujahideen) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mujahideen]  in the  [LINK: (Battle for Hill 3234) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_for_Hill_3234] , later dramatized in the Russian film  [LINK: (The 9th Company) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_9th_Company] . [LINK: ([6]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-6]

[LINK: (January 13) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_13]  – Vice-president  [LINK: (Lee Teng-hui) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Teng-hui]  takes over as President of the  [LINK: (Republic of China) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Republic_of_China]  and Chairman of the  [LINK: (Kuomintang) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kuomintang]  following the death of  [LINK: (Chiang Ching-kuo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiang_Ching-kuo] . [LINK: ([7]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-7]

[LINK: (January 26) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_26]  – Upon request of Hubert Michon,  [LINK: (archbishop of Rabat) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Catholic_Archdiocese_of_Rabat] , two  [LINK: (Trappist) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trappists]  monks come to Fez and start a community that will later become the  [LINK: (Priory of Our Lady of the Atlas) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Priory_of_Our_Lady_of_Atlas] . [LINK: ([8]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-Flachaire-8]

[LINK: (February 12) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_12]  – The  [LINK: (1988 Black Sea bumping incident) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Black_Sea_bumping_incident] : Soviet frigate  [LINK: (Bezzavetnyy) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukrainian_frigate_Dnipropetrovsk]  intentionally rams  [LINK: (USS Yorktown) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/USS_Yorktown_(CG-48)]  in Soviet territorial waters while Yorktown claims  [LINK: (innocent passage) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innocent_passage] . The accompanying US  [LINK: (destroyer) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Destroyer]   [LINK: (USS Caron) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/USS_Caron]  escapes damage. [LINK: ([9]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-9]

[LINK: (February 13) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_13] – [LINK: (28) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_28]  – The  [LINK: (1988 Winter Olympics) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Winter_Olympics]  are held in  [LINK: (Calgary) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calgary] ,  [LINK: (Alberta) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta] , Canada. [LINK: ([10]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-10]

[LINK: (February 17) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_17] 
 [LINK: (1988 Oshakati bomb blast) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Oshakati_bomb_blast] : A bomb explodes outside the  [LINK: (First National Bank) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_National_Bank_(South_Africa)]  in  [LINK: (Oshakati) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshakati] ,  [LINK: (Namibia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namibia] , killing 27 and injuring 70. [LINK: ([11]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-11] 
U.S. Lieutenant Colonel  [LINK: (William R. Higgins) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_R._Higgins] , serving with a  [LINK: (United Nations) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations]  group monitoring a truce in southern  [LINK: (Lebanon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lebanon] , is kidnapped (and later killed by his captors).

[LINK: (1988 Oshakati bomb blast) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988_Oshakati_bomb_blast] : A bomb explodes outside the  [LINK: (First National Bank) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_National_Bank_(South_Africa)]  in  [LINK: (Oshakati) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oshakati] ,  [LINK: (Namibia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namibia] , killing 27 and injuring 70. [LINK: ([11]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-11]

U.S. Lieutenant Colonel  [LINK: (William R. Higgins) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_R._Higgins] , serving with a  [LINK: (United Nations) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Nations]  group monitoring a truce in southern  [LINK: (Lebanon) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lebanon] , is kidnapped (and later killed by his captors).

[LINK: (February 20) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_20]  – The  [LINK: (Nagorno-Karabakh Autonomous Oblast) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagorno-Karabakh_Autonomous_Oblast]  votes to secede from the  [LINK: (Azerbaijan Soviet Socialist Republic) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azerbaijan_Soviet_Socialist_Republic]  and join the  [LINK: (Armenian SSR) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Armenian_Soviet_Socialist_Republic] , triggering the  [LINK: (First Nagorno-Karabakh War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Nagorno-Karabakh_War] .

[LINK: (February 23) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_23]  – Start of  [LINK: (Anfal campaign) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anfal_campaign] , a genocidal  [LINK: (counterinsurgency) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Counterinsurgency]  operation within the  [LINK: (Iran–Iraq War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran%E2%80%93Iraq_War]  carried out by  [LINK: (Ba'athist Iraqi) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ba%27athist_Iraq]  forces led by  [LINK: (Ali Hassan al-Majid) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Hassan_al-Majid]  on the orders of President  [LINK: (Saddam Hussein) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saddam_Hussein]  that will kill between 50,000 and 182,000  [LINK: (Kurds) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurds]  in  [LINK: (Iraqi Kurdistan) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iraqi_Kurdistan] . [LINK: ([12]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-12]  [LINK: ([13]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988#cite_note-13]

[LINK: (February 25) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_25]  – The constitution of the  [LINK: (Sixth Republic of Korea) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sixth_Republic_of_Korea]  comes into effect.

[LINK: (February 27) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_27] – [LINK: (29) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_29]  –  [LINK: (Collapse of the Soviet Union) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collapse_of_the_Soviet_Union] : The  [LINK: (Sumgait pogrom) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumgait_pogrom]  of Armenians occurs in  [LINK: (Sumqayit) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumqayit] .

[LINK: (February 29) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/February_29]  – A  [LINK: (Nazi) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nazi]  document implicates  [LINK: (Kurt Waldheim) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_Waldheim]  in  [LINK: (World War II) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II]  deportations.

